PLR5501 [*] Use `elif` instead of `else` then `if`, to reduce indentation
  --> collapsible_else_if.py:37:5
   |
35 |       if 1:
36 |           pass
37 | /     else:
38 | |         if 2:
   | |________^
39 |               pass
   |
help: Convert to `elif`
   |
37 +     elif 2:
38 +         pass
   |

