PLR5501 [*] Use `elif` instead of `else` then `if`, to reduce indentation
  --> collapsible_else_if.py:55:5
   |
53 |       if 1:
54 |           pass
55 | /     else:
56 | |         # inner comment
57 | |         if 2:
   | |________^
58 |               pass
59 |           else:
   |
help: Convert to `elif`
   |
55 +     # inner comment
56 ~     elif 2:
57 +         pass
58 +     else:
59 +         pass  # final pass comment
   |

PLR5501 [*] Use `elif` instead of `else` then `if`, to reduce indentation
  --> collapsible_else_if.py:69:5
